# The couple's full-resolution originals (~0.96GB). These are the source for
# scripts/build-gallery.mjs, which writes the web-sized copies into
# public/gallery-web/ — those ARE committed. Keeping the originals out means
# a stray `git add -A` cannot push a gigabyte of camera JPEGs into history,
# where they would stay forever.
/public/gallery/
